  vendorName: Caterer DuPont
  offerText: Clear off your entire dining table for my banquet. The food itself is
    completely free, and your body will be perfectly nourished.
  acceptResultText: The food is magnificent and you feel wonderfully healthy. Then
    DuPont hands you an exorbitant, mandatory 'service and cleanup bill' that instantly
    drains your wallet.
  rejectResultText: You turn him away and eat a simple sandwich. It isn't fancy,
    but your wallet remains full.
